name: verify-acceptance-release
description: Independently verify completed decision-scoped software changes against approved acceptance fragments through the maximum safe number of isolated evidence-review lanes, reuse unaffected evidence after local invalidation, then make one serial release decision. Use for release review, final SSOT acceptance, pre-merge or pre-deploy gates, post-fix rereview, and checks for test weakening, architecture bypasses, incomplete external sandbox proof, or missing monitoring and rollback evidence.
